  "question": {
    "text": "Consider :<br />Statement&nbsp;<strong>- <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math>&nbsp;:&nbsp;</strong><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is a fallacy.<br />Statement <strong>-&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>II</mi></math> :&nbsp;</strong><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8596;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is a tautology."
  },
